.\n{9953451728117495}\n**Get to the Core**\n\nMatch the correct color / texture bubbles to remove all similar touching bubbles while more fly in from the sky to throw you off. \n\n{1050302207258882}\n**Collect and Use Power Ups**\n\nPop bubbles strategically to grab power ups and use them to your advantage.\n{1435865291061649}\n**Don't Let it Pop**\n\nAim carefully!\n", "short_description": "Bubbbles is a casual VR/MR puzzle game where you'll need to get to the core of a pile of bubb(b)les! Match the correct color/texture bubbles to remove all similar touching bubbles while more fly in from the sky to throw you off. \n"}]}, "developer_name": "Ben Olding Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.clique.games/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Clique Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://clique.games/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PUZZLE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "23965437116401181"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974778_495104999809052_2075231900391067521_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mMR24MgxZr0Q7kNvwFMg95r&_nc_oc=AdpM9OG_04IBoEi8ZBsw4Uf4gvzAdq706lMJT-a9rV2nQS9vy9dT9lQwzpA-QqJfsrY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-